                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Not a game for everyone, clearly. But I can whole-heartedly recommend this game to people who want a well-written tale of depression and psychological horror. The story is good, voice acting and music are great, the sound design is among the best ever. Visuals fit the theme, and while animations are raw and sparse in an indie way, they also fit the theme and are artfully done",
